ADDITIONAL NOTICE (does not modify the license terms above)

1. ENGINEERING RESPONSIBILITY
   This Software generates design drafts, calculation sheets and PLC source
   code intended for review by qualified automation engineers. It does not
   constitute a safety assessment, a compliance certification, or an
   acceptance conclusion. Safety-related functions (emergency stop, safety
   doors, safety relays, interlocks) must be designed and verified
   independently by competent personnel in accordance with the applicable
   standards (e.g. ISO 13849, IEC 62061, IEC 60204-1 and local regulations).

2. NO THIRD-PARTY CONTENT
   This repository does not distribute any Siemens software, documentation,
   device libraries or standards texts. References to TIA Portal, S7-1200 /
   S7-1500, PLCSIM and similar product names are descriptive only; all
   trademarks belong to their respective owners. Users must supply their own
   licensed tools, device libraries and standard clause libraries.

3. LIVE EQUIPMENT
   Any download to a PLC, online value modification, forcing, or test on real
   machinery changes physical behaviour and may cause injury or damage. Such
   operations require explicit confirmation by the responsible site engineer
   and must never be performed unattended.